  "body": "We just received a bug report that https://lrn.com/  is applying the `popover` attribute on some elements on their training pages which causes them to disappear on engines that implement the popover attribute and prevents from moving forward in the training process.\r\n\r\n@mfreed7 @josepharhar @miketaylr Does Chrome have some use counters to measure potential breakage in the wild? I'm curious if Chrome has a plan to mitigate for such breakage.\r\n",
